# Cargo's build output. At the repository root since GM-284 made this a
# workspace (see the root Cargo.toml); `/core/target` is kept so a checkout
# that still has the pre-workspace directory lying around does not start
# offering it as untracked.
/target
/core/target
# The Rust plugin's conformance fixture is a real cargo workspace, and since
# GM-290 a real rust-analyzer is pointed at it. Its `Cargo.lock` is checked in
# (see that fixture's own Cargo.toml); a `target/` only appears if someone
# turns `checkOnSave` back on in plugins/rust/plugin.toml, and it must not
# become untracked noise if they do.
/plugins/rust/conformance/project/target/
# Release archives produced by scripts/build-targets.sh.
/dist/
.DS_Store
.claude/worktrees/
# Written by plugins/typescript/scripts/generate-version.js on every build.
/plugins/typescript/src/version.generated.ts
